      "v": "judge",
      "t": "Хорошо. Пригласите вашего свидетеля.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "prosecutor",
      "t": "Прошу в зал суда.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Кто это? Вы?!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Just when Arkady thought he was walking out of court on a travel ban, his own public defender has turned up as a witness for the prosecution. You followed all that courtroom Russian; well done. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
